      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخْرَقٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَرْقٌ</span>, in two places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخْرَقُ حَوْضٍ</span>
<i>A stone that is at the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُقْر</span> [or <i>hinder part</i>] <i>of a
